<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Enjoy the grace of Christ each day,</l><l>Each moment live the God-man way;</l><l>For the right timing, watch and pray,</l><l>And be good patterns every day.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This crooked age defiled all lands;</l><l>The church alone most holy stands.</l><l>Coordinate with other saints,</l><l>Young vessels unto honor gain.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
